{"id":"n88425-1-14","stage":1,"title":"휴대폰 · 手机","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88425-1-14-1","ko":"민준이 휴대폰 번호 알아?","zh":"你知道敏俊的手机号码吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"휴대폰","meaning":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","explanation":"휴대폰：手机，移动电话，手提电话","readings":[{"term":"휴대폰","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88425","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴대폰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번호","meaning":"号码","explanation":"번호：号码","readings":[{"term":"번호","audio":"/audio/00e65ebb3d8a52e54e6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31457","senseId":"1","lemma":"번호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2a675ee941a2897e","term":"휴대폰","zh":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3","entryId":"88425","definition":"能拿在手里或带在身上，可以接或打的无线电话。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"00e65ebb3d8a52e5","term":"번호","zh":"号码","audio":"/audio/00e65ebb3d8a52e54e6f.mp3","entryId":"31457","definition":"为了表示次序或区分彼此而添加的数字。","pronunciation":["번호"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c01b3c0255367234947.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88425-1-14-2","ko":"잠깐만. 내 휴대폰에 저장되어 있을 거야.","zh":"稍等，应该存在我手机里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐만.","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"휴대폰에","meaning":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","explanation":"휴대폰：手机，移动电话，手提电话；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"휴대폰","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88425","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴대폰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저장되어","meaning":"被储藏，被保存，被储存，被贮藏","explanation":"저장되다：被储藏，被保存，被储存，被贮藏；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"저장되다","audio":"/audio/493cf05f50fdfc33f407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74624","senseId":"1","lemma":"저장되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57312","definition":"非常短的时间。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"2a675ee941a2897e","term":"휴대폰","zh":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3","entryId":"88425","definition":"能拿在手里或带在身上，可以接或打的无线电话。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"493cf05f50fdfc33","term":"저장되다","zh":"被储藏，被保存，被储存，被贮藏","audio":"/audio/493cf05f50fdfc33f407.mp3","entryId":"74624","definition":"物品或财物等被聚拢保管。","pronunciation":["저ː장되다","저ː장뒈다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/48b14409fa6309f83fb8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.698,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88425","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1781,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["稍等，应该存在我手机里。","该送什么礼物给妻子，她才会高兴呢？","你知道敏俊的手机号码吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["稍等，应该存在我手机里。","你知道敏俊的手机号码吗？","该送什么礼物给妻子，她才会高兴呢？"],"answer":0}]}
